MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 N%=0:F%=0:T%=TIME
>20 EVERY 50,1 GOSUB 100 : REM every second on timer 1
>30 AFTER 250 GOSUB 200 : REM once, after 5 s (timer 0)
>40 REPEAT : UNTIL F% AND TIME>=T%+600
>50 DI:PRINT "ticks>=5 ";N%>=5;" five seconds ";F%:END
>100 N%+=1 : RETURN
>200 F%=1 : RETURN
>RUN
ticks>=5 -1 five seconds 1
>NEW
>ENVELOPE 1,2,1,-1,0,4,4,0,126,-4,0,-126,126,100
>SOUND 1,1,100,40 : REM 2 s of warbling tone on channel 1
>MODE 1 : GCOL 5 : CIRCLE FILL 160,100,50
>GCOL 7 : ELLIPSE 160,100,120,40 : GCOL 3 : FILL 10,10
>LINE 0,0,319,199 : P%=POINT(160,100):Q%=POINT(5,5)
>SPRITE 0,100,80,2 : REM sprite 0 at x 100, y 80 in red
>SPRITE 0 OFF
>MOUSE ON : MOUSE X,Y,B : MOUSE TO 160,100 : MOUSE OFF
>MODE 0:PRINT P%;" ";Q%;" ";X;" ";Y;" ";B
         3 3 160 100 0
>!&8000000=12345 : PRINT !&8000000
     12345
>?&FF80000=7 : PRINT ?&FF80000
         7
>DIM A(60000), B$(1000) : A(60000)=PI : B$(1000)="far" : PRINT A(60000);" ";B$(1000)
3.14159265 far
>DIM B(2),C(2),M(1,1),V(1),W(1),S$(1):B()=1,2,3:C()=4,5,6
>A()=0:PRINT SUM(A())
         0
>DIM D(2):D()=B()+C():PRINT D(0);D(2):D()=B()*2:PRINT D(2):D()=2-B():PRINT D(2):D()=-B():PRINT D(1)
         59
         6
        -1
        -2
>M()=1,2,3,4:V()=5,6:W()=M().V():PRINT W(0);" ";W(1)
        17 39
>S$()="a","b":S$()=S$()+"!":PRINT S$(0);S$(1);" ";SUMLEN(S$());" ";DIM(M(),1)
a!b! 4 1
